Casts an illusionary magic on all of your units on the map, causing them to become temporarily invisible. If no allied units are seen by the enemy shortly after, you will regain your stealth status.

|cffaeaeaeThis spell has a 4 second cast time and a 120 second cooldown. Use it wisely.
}

